# NOTE: bot_state*.json / trades*.json / readiness_*.json / paper_readiness.json /
# walk_forward_results_*.json under data/ are NOT ignored. research/bots/bot_runner.py
# writes them locally and CI (bot.yml, refresh_gates.yml) commits them back to master —
# they ARE the persistence layer for now. Do not re-add them here until bot_runner.py
# is actually migrated to write through backend/models.py to a durable external DB
# (a GitHub Actions runner's local filesystem, including any local SQLite file, is
# destroyed at the end of every job — gitignoring these without that migration means
# every run starts from a blank slate and readiness_gate.py's fail-closed check can
# never pass).

